  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network for university co-operation Tibet-Norway</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to educational Scholarship Programme, PhD,and research collaboration with Tibetan researchers 2011-2014.

The program is aiming at: Enhanced scientific competence and associated self-reinliance in Tibet.
The Purpose of the Project is
&#x2022; Stronger competence and higher professional quality in the educational and research sector.
&#x2022; Tibetan academics qualified for research at international level.
&#x2022; Tibetan academics qualified to carry out independent research projects.
&#x2022; New research-based insight into the environment, culture, and society of Tibet</narrative>
  </description>
